# Line endings: LF in the repository *and* in the working tree, on every platform - the same rule the rest
# of the org uses (`ipaas2/.gitattributes`). `.editorconfig` says the same thing to editors; this says it to
# git, so `dotnet format --verify-no-changes` can hold the line in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# What the package ships: a bitmap stays a bitmap.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.nupkg binary
